# ─── Derived search indexes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every project's search index is rebuildable from its own manifest + sources/,
# and every reindex rewrites the whole blob. Committing it means the repository
# grows by the full index size on every commit. system-instructions' core index
# reached 6.4 MB tracked; across a corpus of many projects that is untenable.
# Rebuild with the project's own update.py instead.
search_index.json
**/search_index.json

# ─── Raw session evidence ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# sources/ holds raw session-content candidates staged for curation. A real
# leaked credential was found in exactly this kind of pool during a curation
# pass on the private predecessor. Raw dumps stay out of git by default; a
# curated, secret-swept .md rendering is what gets committed deliberately.
**/governance/sources/raw/
**/governance/sources/*.jsonl

# A global-adjacent capture is regenerated from a live, still-open session file
# on every recapture and only grows — one reached 163 MB and exceeded GitHub's
# 100 MB blob limit. The true native original lives outside git anyway.
**/*-global-adjacent.json

# ─── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never a substitute for the mandatory secret sweep before any evidence lands
# in a tracked folder — this only stops the obvious cases.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
secrets.yaml

# ─── Run output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dated, disposable analysis output is never source.
**/runs/*
!**/runs/.gitkeep

# Update reports are one-per-invocation operational churn, fully regenerable from the
# same inputs. Security findings are NOT ignored: a dated finding carries a proposed
# disposition awaiting human approval, which makes it an auditable record rather than
# output.
**/governance/reports/*
!**/governance/reports/.gitkeep

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# ─── Node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ─── OS and editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# ─── Stray tool artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Some globally-installed MCP tools drop logging stubs into whatever directory
# a session's cwd happens to be, whether or not they are ever used.
.openchrome/
